			<div class="content" id="post-content-3584176">
									

<p>This idea was initially about Suzanne Vega's<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-414701-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-414701-1')">1</a></sup> song <em>Tom's diner</em>, under the curiosity of &quot;what if an mp3 exists that can talk using their lyrics?&quot;. So I figured this idea may be a good one and decided to draft a description and interview and posted it on the forums. I wasn't particularly expecting any good feedback since my writing is not in a good shape right now, but somehow Zyn saw interest in the idea.</p>
<p>Anyway, I wrote the draft and Zyn wrote this SCP. To be honest, I'm sad because I didn't write the whole, but at the same, I'm still glad and happy because it's like I made the wormy caterpillar or something, the reviewers (<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedantique" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3118444); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3118444&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571310692" alt="Pedantique" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3118444)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedantique" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3118444); return false;">Pedantique</a></span>, Pendleton_Miller, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1722371); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1722371&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571310692" alt="Shaggydredlocks" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1722371)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/shaggydredlocks" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1722371); return false;">Shaggydredlocks</a></span> &amp; <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571310692" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;">Leveritas</a></span>) the cocoon, and ultimately <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1404533&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1571310692" alt="Zyn" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1404533)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zyn" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1404533); return false;">Zyn</a></span> made the butterfly. :)</p>
<p>For the draft, <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/kenoma-zyn-collaboration">click this</a>.<br />
For the thread, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/forum/t-3454822">click this</a>.</p>
