<ul>
<li>Did you mean purpose? &gt; no, it was meant to indicate that the explanation was given as a cover story. I've trimmed that sentence down so it doesn't use the confusing wording.</li>
<li>This is perhaps just a stylistic nitpick, but examples of such websites &gt; added! I've never illegally downloaded music before, so admittedly it didn't cross my mind to put examples in.</li>
